<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!-- Tektronix 8301 Microprocessor Development Unit, front panel. Box after the 8550 brochure photo
     (sources/tekwiki/8550/8550_1.jpg): grilles and a plain name panel on the left, grilles and the
     control strip on the right. The control strip is drawn after the identical one on an 8540 (photo
     from the VCFed thread "Tektronix 85xx MDL system"): RESTART toggle; SYSTEM, PROGRAM, DMA, SELF TEST
     lamps with vertical labels; POWER rocker (070-2976 Fig. 1-3). The System Controller board LEDs
     (port ED) are inside: shown on a strip below. -->
